window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>I thought I'd found the perfect place at MistHallow Academy and after a rocky start, I hoped things would settle. But the ancient forest surrounding our sanctuary awakens, pulsing with magic that calls to me, and only me, it seems.</b></p> <p>I think I'm the key to unlocking this primordial power—a power that could save or destroy the supernatural world. Each of my guys embodies a different aspect of this magic, and I'm caught in the middle.</p> <p>I'm grappling with a force beyond my understanding, and it gets worse: my sire, the vampire I've been running from, has resurfaced. He claims he's here to protect me, but can I trust the monster who turned me against my will?</p> <p>With the academy on edge and the forest's magic growing stronger by the day, I'm walking a tightrope between desire and duty. One misstep could plunge our world into chaos.</p> <p>I never asked to be the fulcrum on which the fate of the supernatural world teeters, and yet. As the veils between love, power, and danger blur, I'll have to decide who to trust—and who to love.</p> <p><i>This is a dark paranormal romance and is book two out of three in a brand new reverse harem romance by </i>USA Today<i> bestselling author, Eve Newton. Contains mature content. A complete list of content warnings can be found on the author's website.</i></p>"; 
